  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan places Hei Fan grotto-heaven’s heavenly crystal storage pool into Mini Azure Heaven. The pool is built in the sky and surrounded by Gu formations, but the light azure heavenly crystals occupy only a small central area. In a blessed land the pool cannot produce new heavenly crystals the way it could in a grotto-heaven.",
